{"4546370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starport Merchants", "steam_appid": 4546370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/3f236b82b0a5bfb0f8c26793279644ad.webp?t=1787926997\" width=926 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0c8cc01c97f43c6d9e7d471c69964d6a.poster.avif?t=1787926997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0c8cc01c97f43c6d9e7d471c69964d6a.webm?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0c8cc01c97f43c6d9e7d471c69964d6a.mp4?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/65444ba0abb656dfad7ec6c64df6b0ac.webp?t=1787926997\" width=926 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starport Merchants</strong> puts you in the boots of a scrappy trader, starting with nothing but a small ship and some pocket money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between the planets looking for opportunity and the most optimal way to build your business empire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/d23df7aaa3ff243c6eb6526f3b8115a8.poster.avif?t=1787926997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/d23df7aaa3ff243c6eb6526f3b8115a8.webm?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/d23df7aaa3ff243c6eb6526f3b8115a8.mp4?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/66adff9c4ff4df13280b10d6fcd3bde4.webp?t=1787926997\" width=926 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many ways to build up your merchant empire. Discover the income streams that fit your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do a little bit of everything, it's your business after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul cargo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take jobs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport passengers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smuggle goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade stocks (or short them)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate fleets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in real estate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble at the casino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize a planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... but don't forget to pay your taxes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/67722a98f9fd09ec455430df52034452.poster.avif?t=1787926997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/67722a98f9fd09ec455430df52034452.webm?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/67722a98f9fd09ec455430df52034452.mp4?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/5bc15388685c5dc0b68f3cef903ad869.webp?t=1787926997\" width=926 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/4b7576e3853ca18e820bdffa23605a54.webp?t=1787926997\" width=402 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in your pursuit to rule the markets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against <strong>seven rival merchants</strong> or find a way to work together. Each rival has their own distinct personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0059921279baad3037130d3f815bf725.poster.avif?t=1787926997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0059921279baad3037130d3f815bf725.webm?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0059921279baad3037130d3f815bf725.mp4?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the <strong>distinct personalities</strong> of your rivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish <strong>Trade Agreements</strong> and learn to work together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>games</strong> together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... or commit <strong>Industrial Sabotage</strong> and set your rivals back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/14dfbbfa3ef7f65003c6f3985c768f46.poster.avif?t=1787926997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/14dfbbfa3ef7f65003c6f3985c768f46.webm?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/14dfbbfa3ef7f65003c6f3985c768f46.mp4?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/7eec142ac1cc693e7f0ff4f6262c2e65.webp?t=1787926997\" width=926 height=59 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple revenue paths:</strong> Choose how you want to build and monetize your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level playing field:</strong> Rivals follow the same rules and play the same game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crisis events:</strong> Unexpected events can raise or lower earnings. For you and your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed finances:</strong> Know exactly how your money flows in and out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual analytics:</strong> Use charts and graphs to analyze performance and trends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative choices:</strong> Encounter story events during your travels. Decide how to handle them (or ignore them).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this game for you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough of <strong>Starport Merchants</strong> might take some time, but the game is designed for quick, pick‑up‑and‑play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for players who want a <strong>tycoon game with just enough depth</strong> but that doesn’t require hours of study.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great choice if you enjoy <strong>GUI‑based tycoon games</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comparable titles include <strong>Gazillionaire</strong>, <strong>Dope Wars</strong> and <strong>Wall Street Raider</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When in doubt, play the demo!</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/3f236b82b0a5bfb0f8c26793279644ad.webp?t=1787926997\" width=926 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0c8cc01c97f43c6d9e7d471c69964d6a.poster.avif?t=1787926997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0c8cc01c97f43c6d9e7d471c69964d6a.webm?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/0c8cc01c97f43c6d9e7d471c69964d6a.mp4?t=1787926997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546370/extras/65444ba0abb65